## Interface: 16001
## AllowLoadGameType: camelot
## Title: Midnight Helper Forever
## Version: 5.0.2
## Author: TwelveInchy
## Category: User Interface
## Notes: Midnight Helper for WoW Forever: what to learn at your trainer (Train all, an arrow and a cross), how your class plays, a key block for all nine classes, a missing-buff button, bag and mana warnings, and a quest reward hint.
