# 🧩 WoW Forever TOC (5 Nov 2026, docs/PLAN_FOREVER_2026-11-05.md step 1; Rob: "Ja, stap 1").
# Same folder, same files as MidnightHelper.toc: only the engine, the key/bar tools and the arrow. Forever reads this
# file because of AllowLoadGameType camelot (measured: EllesmereUIForeverEssentials_Camelot.toc); retail ignores it.
# ⚠️ Keep the order of MidnightHelper.toc. A file added there does NOT appear here by itself: decide per file.
# Left out on purpose: everything Midnight (delves, Valeera, Labyrinth, rituals, vault, M+, raids, rares, Codex, season),
# Midnight data and locale packs, the travel planner (Midnight places), the probes, onboarding tour and nudges.

